                        "form": "зако̀нопослу́шней"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3768768e-4f62-3cd3-a3d4-82d746c63dd3",
                        "entry_id": "323f5bb7-df9e-3c8a-87fd-320975e41275",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. соблюдающий действующие законы, подчиняющийся им"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd24ea13-8a31-41ed-8077-41e6dbf24a33",
                                "sense_id": "3768768e-4f62-3cd3-a3d4-82d746c63dd3",
                                "text": "Полк был законопослушен и тем все более навлекал на себя злобу и обвинение в «контрреволюционности»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f4de97c-cff1-4679-9bd3-347ef78d3964",
                                "sense_id": "3768768e-4f62-3cd3-a3d4-82d746c63dd3",
                                "text": "Кролики снова притихли и стали законопослушными."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f9fc6fc-6b1b-451b-aeb5-9c59142371fe",
                                "sense_id": "3768768e-4f62-3cd3-a3d4-82d746c63dd3",
                                "text": "Быть послушным закону не значит быть «законопослушным» в юридическом смысле этого слова, то есть быть исполнителем правил, остающихся для нас внешними."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f57a8c9-da2c-4d08-9200-81d4abc6438f",
                        "source_entry_id": "323f5bb7-df9e-3c8a-87fd-320975e41275",
                        "source_sense_id": "3768768e-4f62-3cd3-a3d4-82d746c63dd3",
                        "target_lang_word": "law-abiding",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "law-abiding",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4745d525-69c3-3cbb-ae13-f4bac175ccba",
                                        "entry_id": "2caff491-717a-3e1c-bd34-b7c2b27326fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obeying the laws of society; not a lawbreaker; without a criminal record."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3388b44a-5fc2-4f95-bf51-6ad453d5ff06",
                                                "sense_id": "4745d525-69c3-3cbb-ae13-f4bac175ccba",
                                                "text": "The law-abiding citizens have nothing to fear from government surveillance... unless the government begins to break the law."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88138f02-d7e3-443f-9949-6474c1972e7f",
                                                "sense_id": "4745d525-69c3-3cbb-ae13-f4bac175ccba",
                                                "text": "In all smuggling places ghost stories abound. Can it be that they were invented to keep law-abiding folk behind closed doors at night, when the deeds were being done?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5c1bf3d-2c6f-4621-8aa3-62538123fb3c",
                                                "sense_id": "4745d525-69c3-3cbb-ae13-f4bac175ccba",
                                                "text": "“For any decent, law-abiding citizen, there is no honour in this. None at all. You are a bad man, Mr Goodie. And, worst of all, a bad dad. A very bad dad.” That hit Gilbert like a ton of bricks. He looked over to his son with tears in his eyes, as the judge announced the sentence. “Gilbert Goodie, I sentence you to ten years in prison!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
